sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 档案管理员
    participant W as Web
    participant A as ArchiveController
    participant D as DanghaoService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Q as BullMQ
    participant X as Extractor
    participant M as MinIO
    participant ES as Elasticsearch
    U->>W: 填写件级表单并提交
    W->>A: POST /api/archives/volumes/:vid/items
    A->>D: assignDanghao(fondsId, categoryId, ctx)
    D->>DB: SELECT ... FOR UPDATE danghao_sequence(scope_key)
    D->>DB: UPDATE next_value+1; COMMIT
    D-->>A: 档号(唯一约束兜底重试)
    A->>DB: INSERT archive_item
    A-->>W: {code:0,data:item}
    W->>M: 分片直传电子文件(预签名)
    W->>A: POST /api/files/complete
    A->>M: 重算 SHA-256 比对
    A->>DB: INSERT electronic_file(PENDING)
    A->>Q: enqueue extract(fileId)
    X->>Q: 消费
    X->>M: 读原件/写预览与缩略图
    X->>DB: INSERT document_text; status=OK
    X->>ES: INDEX 元数据+正文(IK)
    U->>ES: 全文检索(AccessFilterBuilder 密级/范围过滤 + 高亮 + 分面)
